<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Policy Implications</h1>

  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px; font-size: 12pt;">
    <li>Dual credit has a positive impact on completion.
      <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 30px; margin-top: 10px;">
        <li>For low income students, a dual credit course was associated with a <span data-field="policy_low_income_impact">{{ policy_low_income_impact }}</span> greater likelihood of completing a bachelors degree.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Four year institutions should engage in dual credit, particularly in subject areas not available at community colleges.</li>
    <li>Restoration of funding for dual credit is an appropriate investment towards completion goals.</li>
  </ul>
